From 348e521ff2d2b44c6ec92a054ff1e9ec6c503eac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ewoog <Ewoog@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:25:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add farm mode: .botcmd farm/farmstop and
 FARM/FARMSTOP/GETFARM addon verbs

A bot ordered to farm keeps attacking the nearest live, attackable,
untapped creature of the commanding player's selected entry within a
radius (default 40, clamped 10-100) of an anchor taken from the bot's
position when the order is given. The scan runs from UpdateOffensive's
idle branch after looting and resting and before following the leader
or the open-world layer, at most once a second per bot. With nothing up
the bot walks back to the anchor and waits. A farming bot loots its
own kills even in a group. Follow, Stay, StopAttack, map/instance
change, relog and despawn (Forget) end farm mode.
---
